text:
Voice AI calls just got a privacy upgrade. 🔒

@DeepgramAI now runs fully on-prem with encrypted audio and model weights, powered by @fortanix  Confidential AI and NVIDIA Confidential Computing.

Read the press release: https://t.co/h4yqRdFpMr

📣 Useful AI has arrived — and NAVER is building the infrastructure to meet it at scale.

@official_naver will expand its GAK Sejong data center using the NVIDIA DSX platform, starting at 55 megawatts with plans to reach gigawatt scale, powering sovereign and physical AI models, agents and enterprise workloads across Korea and beyond.

🔗 Learn more: https://t.co/ZdfyDIuJT0

#NVIDIAGTC Taipei News:

NVIDIA introduced NemoClaw, OpenShell and Nemotron models to help enterprises build AI coworkers.

@Cadence, @Dassault3DS, @Siemens and @Synopsys are using NVIDIA NemoClaw to create autonomous AI engineers that can compress weeks of simulation and verification work into hours. https://t.co/WlpgGhGP3G

How do we power the next American century? 🇺🇸⚡️

@ENERGY Secretary Chris Wright, @nvidia’s @ia_buck, and #SCSPTech’s @Ylli_Bajraktari take the South Stage to break down the mission-critical link between #AI, energy infrastructure, and the compute backbone of the future.

#AIExpoDC

.@OpenClaw hit 250K GitHub stars in 60 days — the fastest climb in GitHub history. 

@steipete built something developers desperately wanted. 

We worked with him to make it enterprise-ready. https://t.co/oHpt65CIJU

Thank you to our GTC Live hosts and guests for joining us at the keynote pregame. 

The show brought together top leaders across tech, infrastructure, and industry to explore how accelerated computing and AI are transforming everything from chip design and data centers to manufacturing and robotics. 

@saranormous @GavinSBaker @Alfred_Lin #NVIDIAGTC

“The car is now a thinking machine.”

@MercedesBenz CEO Ola Källenius shares how NVIDIA DRIVE AV enables advanced driver assistance in the all-new Mercedes-Benz CLA, available later this year. 

▶️ Watch the video: https://t.co/31VQmX90Of https://t.co/lsodHZmzvT

The next data center frontier is in orbit. 

@CNBC highlights @starcloud_, an NVIDIA Inception member, which trained the first LLMs in space on NVIDIA.

In-orbit AI workloads can cut energy use and cooling demands, with Starcloud projecting energy costs could be 10x lower, while supporting disaster-response and safety use cases that protect people and the planet.

As AI grows more complex, model builders rely on NVIDIA.

@OpenAI’s GPT-5.2 and other leading models including @Runwayml leverage NVIDIA’s tech stack to advance frontier of AI.

Read More: https://t.co/3Npp12CMmD https://t.co/mGAYdza8ty

A year that redefined industries, and accelerated the future of computing. 

@TIME sat down with NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang, exploring how NVIDIA’s breakthroughs in AI and accelerated computing are shaping the next industrial revolution.  

This incredible progress wouldn’t be possible without our employees and global ecosystem of partners - the innovators, builders, and dreamers harnessing this technology to transform every industry.

America's leading robotics companies are powering the next wave of reindustrialization. 🤖

@agilityrobotics, @amazon robotics, @Figure_robot, and @SkildAI are adopting the NVIDIA three-computer solution to deploy physical AI powered robotic fleets to bridge skills gaps, boost productivity, and improve safety across industries. #NVIDIAGTC

Read the press release: https://t.co/mscT6U2TKx

